{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05946","headline":"奉和圣制天长节赐宰臣歌应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制天长节赐宰臣歌应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳升兮照万方，开阊阖兮临玉堂。\n俨冕旒兮垂衣裳，金天净兮丽三光。\n彤庭曙兮延八荒，德合天兮礼神徧。\n灵芝生兮庆云见，唐尧后兮稷卨臣。\n匝宇宙兮华胥人，尽九服兮皆四邻，乾降瑞兮坤降珍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}